WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.400
The wooden gates of the Timberfall checkpoint
rise before you.

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:06.390
A group of stoic guards stand watch as their
captain steps forward,

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:09.320
hand on his sword, and looks you over.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.210
Not so fast, travelers!

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:15.740
I am Sir Dmitri Bronzhelm, captain of this
gate.

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:20.000
I'm hunting Jade Dawnweaver, and you fit her
accomplices' look.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.080
What business have you in Timberfall?

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:29.520
I'm just a traveler passing through. Who are
you looking for?

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:34.520
Jade Dawnweaver, traitor to the Queen, and her
helpers.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:38.000
You've got that look. What's your answer?

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.260
Hold on, what did you say your name was?

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:48.580
Sir Dmitri Bronzhelm. Now your turn.

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:50.180
What are you doing here?

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:57.920
All right, I take out a gold coin and hand it
out to him.

00:01:00.840 --> 00:01:03.880
Roll to see if Dmitri takes the coin and waves
you through.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:12.000
[Dice rattle]

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:23.860
A glint of gold, and Dmitri's stern gaze
softens.

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.880
He slips the coin away, then with a curt nod,

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:29.260
steps aside and signals his men to make room.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.880
You pass through the gate into Timberfall,
bound for the Laughing Oak Tavern.

00:01:41.480 --> 00:01:46.700
No sooner than you enter the Laughing Oak
Tavern, a frail hand grips your wrist.

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:50.540
An old woman, eyes darting to the door, pulls
you close.

00:01:53.820 --> 00:01:56.460
You... you're a friend of my daughter.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:59.100
I am Tabitha, Jade's mother.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:01.460
I have a message, but...

00:02:02.020 --> 00:02:03.710
I can't speak freely.

00:02:03.950 --> 00:02:06.760
The Queen's eyes and ears are everywhere.

00:02:09.640 --> 00:02:12.810
A stranger who has been watching from a nearby
table

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:15.060
rises and closes on Tabitha.

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:19.120
Then there's a flash of metal from his
concealed hand as he strikes at her.

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:20.220
What do you do?

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:26.080
I jump at him and try to knock him down.

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:29.740
Roll to see if you knock him down.

00:02:47.440 --> 00:02:51.380
He twists aside, and your leap carries you
into a table.

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:55.630
Pain flashes through your ribs as he turns on
you, blade raised.

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:59.660
“Death to the Lantern Bearer rebellion!” He
lunges again.

00:03:00.370 --> 00:03:01.860
What do you do?

00:03:04.820 --> 00:03:09.860
I grab a chair and swing at him and ask him,
“What the hell are you doing here?”

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.920
Roll to see if that chair connects.

00:03:30.840 --> 00:03:34.210
The chair crashes into the man, driving him
back.

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:36.800
Beneath her cloak, Tabitha draws a sword

00:03:36.810 --> 00:03:41.650
as tough-looking men and women bearing
lanterns rise and surround him.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.060
Outnumbered, he bolts for the door.

00:03:44.070 --> 00:03:47.150
Tabitha whirls toward you, sword raised, and
she shouts.

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:51.260
Don't... don't let him get away!

00:03:54.820 --> 00:03:58.340
I chase him and tackle him at the door.

00:03:59.180 --> 00:04:02.360
Roll to see if you bring him down at the door.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:26.120
You slam into the assassin at the door,
pinning him hard against the floor.

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:27.400
He spits,

00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:31.780
“Wretched Lantern Bearer scum! The Queen sends
her regards.”

00:04:32.700 --> 00:04:37.860
The lantern holders haul him off as Tabitha
lowers her sword and shakes her head.

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:44.280
No, it's no longer safe for us here.

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:45.760
You must go to Jade.

00:04:46.140 --> 00:04:50.220
She'll meet you by the Sprite Altar, just
beyond the walls of Timberfall.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.720
You can go by way of Bonehallow Cemetery,

00:04:53.730 --> 00:04:56.680
but beware a wicked witch who curses all
trespassers.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:59.400
Or take the Windswept Cliffs, but beware,

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:02.540
there's a gang of desperate highwaymen.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:04.480
The choice is yours.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:10.090
Let's...
